      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It is clear that the current situation is a profound deviation from the established doctrines you helped codify. If those foundational principles of maritime sovereignty and strategic depth had been rigorously applied, the disputes would have been managed through established protocols of mutual recognition and calibrated deterrence. The historical success of those eras relied on adherence to shared, codified understandings, which would have prevented the current escalation by providing clear, respected boundaries for all actors.",
